---
pagination:
  data: "leaguesByTab['draft-odds']"
  size: 1
  alias: league
permalink: "/{{ league.slug }}/draft-odds/"
layout: layouts/league-shell.njk
currentTab: draft-odds
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ league.name }} — Draft Odds"
---
<section class="draft-board" aria-labelledby="draft-odds-title">
  <header class="draft-board-header">
    <h2 id="draft-odds-title">Rookie Draft Odds</h2>
    <div class="draft-board-meta"><strong>Round 1</strong><span id="draft-odds-week"></span></div>
  </header>
  <p id="draft-odds-status" role="status" class="draft-board-status">Loading Sleeper standings and pick ownership…</p>
  <div id="draft-odds-content" hidden>
    <section id="draft-odds-spotlight" class="draft-spotlight" aria-labelledby="draft-odds-spotlight-title" hidden>
      <div>
        <h3 id="draft-odds-spotlight-title">No. 1 overall odds</h3>
        <div id="draft-odds-favorite" class="draft-favorite"></div>
      </div>
      <ul id="draft-odds-challengers" class="draft-challengers" aria-label="Other contenders"></ul>
    </section>
    <h3 id="draft-odds-order-title" class="draft-order-title">Projected first-round order</h3>
    <div id="draft-odds-body"></div>
    <footer class="draft-methodology">
      <p>Non-playoff teams pick from lowest to highest Max PF. Playoff teams show PF and pick in reverse seed order until playoff results set their slots. The champion’s pick is 1.14.</p>
      <details>
        <summary>Tiebreakers, ownership, and odds</summary>
        <p>Higher PF breaks record ties in the standings. For exact Max PF ties, the weaker regular-season seed picks first. When teams exit the playoffs in the same round without a placement game, the stronger regular-season seed picks later.</p>
        <p>Each slot follows the original franchise. Sleeper’s trade ledger determines who holds the pick.</p>
        <p>The percentage beside each pick is its estimated chance of landing at the displayed slot. The model runs 5,000 simulations of the remaining schedule and playoff bracket, resampling weekly scores and using the season-to-date gap between PF and Max PF to estimate future Max PF.</p>
      </details>
    </footer>
  </div>
</section>

<script id="draft-odds-league-config" type="application/json">{{ league | dump | safe }}</script>
<script type="module" src="/assets/js/draft-odds.js"></script>
